igure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s3","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.001 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s4","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"Figure 1 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s5","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"MLP has a loss of 1.454 at epoch 1.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s6","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"At epoch 4, the loss of ResNet-50 is 0.632 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s7","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"As shown in Figure 1, ResNet-50 has a loss of about 0.5 at epoch 6.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s8","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"Figure 2 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s9","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"On CIFAR-10, ResNet-18 obtains a validation accuracy of 61.4%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s10","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"ResNet-18 outperforms BERT-base by 14.4 percentage points on AG News (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s11","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"As shown in Figure 2, BERT-base outperforms CNN by 54.2 percentage points on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s12","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"As shown in Figure 2, on SVHN, ResNet-18 obtains a validation accuracy of 93.4%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s13","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"Figure 3 shows the accuracy of BERT-base by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s14","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"BERT-base reaches 85.6% accuracy on SST-2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s15","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"As shown in Figure 3, on SST-2, BERT-base obtains a accuracy of 85.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s16","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"BERT-base scores 28.3 points higher on MNIST than on SST-2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s17","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"On AG News, Naive Bayes obtains an accuracy of 89.0%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout3_002_s18","report_id":"holdout3_002","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}